  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil kettle.\n• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Drain and rinse kidney beans. Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a90a964851973ef45fd4f/step-2fc1b74d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place couscous and crumbled vegetable stock (1 cube for 2P / 2 cubes for 4P) in a medium bowl.\n• Add boiling water (see ingredients) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with a plate and set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a90a964851973ef45fd4f/step-994a32f0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot until softened, 2-4 mins. Add BBQ spice blend, corn and kidney beans and cook, stirring, until combined, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in diced tomatoes and crumbled vegetable stock (1 cube for 2P / 2 cubes for 4P). Simmer until thickened, 4-5 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a90a964851973ef45fd4f/step-0b43f8a0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir baby spinach, butter and brown sugar into beans.\n• Divide couscous between bowls and top with veggie bean stew. Serve with yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a90a964851973ef45fd4f/step-d759c5cd.jpg"
    }
  ]
